WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.784
Roman symbols include I equals 1, V equals 5, X equals 10, L equals 50 and C equals

00:00:07.784 --> 00:00:11.997
100. Use IV, IX, XL and XC for subtraction forms.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:21.158
Write 29 as a Roman numeral. The answer is XXIX. Roman numerals use I, V, X, L and C:

00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:22.467
29 equals XXIX.

00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:28.650
A clock label for a school fundraiser is XLVII. What number is it? Pause the video

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.321
and think.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:37.780
A clock label for a school fundraiser is XLVII. What number is it? The answer is 47.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.117
XLVII represents 47.
